<title>USA: American Air Dec load factor at 68.4 pct.</title>
<headline>American Air Dec load factor at 68.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>FORT WORTH, Texas 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>AMR Corp's American Airlines on Friday said its systemwide load factor in December increased 4.3 percentage points year over year to 68.4 percent.  </p>
<p>The carrier said in a release that systemwide traffic increased 6.9 percent and its capacity grew by a 0.1 percent.</p>
<p>Domestic traffic increased 9.0 percent, with capacity up 1.1 percent. International traffic rose by 2.3 percent, with capacity down 2.1 percent.</p>
</text>
